    "abstract": "Parts figure for the flight control primary computer rack installation, covering the solenoid kit, the sensor sub-assembly, the cooling hose and the clamping, with the loadable configuration standard called out at rack level.",
    "sections": {
      "purpose": "This figure identifies the flight control primary computer rack items and the hardware whose rigging tolerance is tied to the loaded configuration standard.",
      "figure_note": "Sheet 1 shows the avionics bay rack looking forward with both computers installed. The computers themselves are supplied as rotables and are not detailed here. The loadable configuration data set is called out at rack level for configuration control only; it is not a spare and cannot be ordered as a part. The solenoid kit at item 10 has a different rigging tolerance for each configuration standard, and the applicable table is given in the loading task rather than in this figure."
    },
